Bag of holding abuse:  Take a normal bag of holding, drop everything
except it and a potion of unholy water, get you're strength as high
as possible.  Grab as much worthless junk as possible (rocks are best
for this), put them in bag.  Grab more junk, put in bag, repeat as
much as possible, until you can't grab anything else.  #Dip the bag
into the unholy water, take all the rocks out, toss em on the ground.
You now have a bag of negative weight, you'll now be able to walk
around with a couple dead dragons, and then some.

